{
  "_comment": "Props from the Quaternius Fantasy Props MegaKit (free Standard: 94 models). Sets are small arrangements of kit models; layout props (stalls, benches, barrels...) are drawn from them, and buildings get extra exterior dressing by type. Everything is merged into a few meshes per 64 m chunk (one surface per shared material). The well, charter banners and signposts are Village Commons models (below), the market cross, the trough and the square's kerb are Market Square models; rocks keep their simple shapes; haystacks and the lumber pile come from the Farm & Field family (variants).",
