  "_commons": "The Village Commons (3D/props/village-commons): the well, charter banners and signposts are this game's own models and grow finer with the charter (index 0 Hamlet, 1 Village, 2 Market Town, 3 Town). Banners and signposts merge with the props; the well is placed whole so it keeps its LODs. A banner's arm is mirrored when it would reach into a building ('banner_reach' meters).",
